		<link rel="alternate" href="http://forums.postgresql.fr/viewtopic.php?pid=23720#p23720"/>
		<content type="html"><![CDATA[<p>Merci pour ta réponse. Oui je l&#039;ai finalement avec NEW et OLD<br />IF (TG_OP = &#039;UPDATE&#039;) THEN<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; IF (NEW.valid_to != OLD.valid_to) THEN <br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; INSERT INTO audit VALUES(uuid_generate_v4(), ...);<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ELSIF (NEW.rate != OLD.rate) THEN<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; INSERT INTO audit VALUES(...);<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; ELSIF(NEW.workflow_state != OLD.workflow_state) THEN<br />&#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; &#160; INSERT INTO audit VALUES(...<br />&#160; &#160;END IF;</p>]]></content>
